{"subtitle":"","author":"子戈","category":"专栏 · 看片指南","collection":"","publishedAt":"2023-03-02T18:00","status":"published","cover":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-001.jpg","festival":"","partnership":false,"id":"img-8978","title":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！","archiveCategory":"guide","blocks":[{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 1","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-001.jpg","imageText":""},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 2","caption":"","width":70,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-002.jpg","imageText":"3月院线看片指南▷▷▷"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 3","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-003.jpg","imageText":"最为期待 —— 2部\nOur Aspiration！"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 4","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-004.jpg","imageText":"《不止不休》\n8.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月24日1第4个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：陌陌影业","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分7.5-8.0/票房3-5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题√新闻理想看点√能否成为下一个药神？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"很多人在说，《不止不休》是下一个药神。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此话一出，基本明白了本片的调性和格局。它一定比大部分国产片都要尖锐、有力度，但天花板在于，它也很可能像药神一样，只能把枪口从大老虎身上挪开，对准小喽啰。毕竟，比起药品管制，新闻自由是更难触碰的问题。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但不管怎样，在普遍溃疡的时代，隔靴搔痒已是恩赐。既然《毒舌大状》能在香港爆，同理推之，《不止不休》怎么就不能在内地爆呢？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"我很期待这部电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"如果说有唯一的保留之处，那就是这部2020年就拍好的电影，压到今天才上，谁知道这小三年的时间里，被动了几次剪刀？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 5","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-005.jpg","imageText":"《铃芽之旅》\n7.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月24日1第4个周五出品方：CoMixWaveFilms","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：票房1.5-2.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题√灾后创伤看点√新海诚真的要拍“大地震三部曲”？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"新海诚连着三部电影，都涉及“3·11大地震”。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《你的名字》《天气之子》分别用“彗星陨落”和“无端水患”来侧写灾难后的世界，这一部《铃芽之旅》，则以公路片的形式，串联起日本大地上的片片废墟。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"反复拍同一场灾难，可见痛之深切。而我更关心的是，在这场历经十几年的PTSD疗愈过程中，新海诚是否有了新的答案。他能否抛开小情小爱，放下“倾城之恋”，进入更深层的痛苦？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这是我的期待，也是疑问。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"值得关注 6部It'sNoteworthy","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 6","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-006.jpg","imageText":"《保你平安》\n保你平安\n3月10日造谣一张嘴辟谣跑断腿\n7.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月10日1第2个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：上海儒意影视","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分7.0-7.5/票房4-6亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题√网络谣言看点大鹏真能一部比一部拍得好？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"天鹏特别会选题。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《煎饼侠》拍草根逆袭，和同年的夏洛堪称常丝双雄；《缝纫机乐队》王打摇滚情怀牌，比乐夏还早了两年。到《吉祥如意》，他又拨弄起文艺片受众的心思，把伪纪录、真纪实玩得像模像样。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"到这次的《保你平安》，他又瞄准了时下热点一一网络谣言（还是黄谣）。可以想见：又是用戏来揭露现实之荒谬的做戏思路。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"不可否认，天鹏一直在进步。那么这次能否更进一步？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 7","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-007.jpg","imageText":"《断网》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月3日1首个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：银都","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.0/票房0.8-1亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点√视觉化了的暗网世界，能搞出新意来吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"本片在内地上映比香港还要早儿大，但有一分钟删减。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"阵容挺强大，郭富城、林家栋、任达华同台飙戏，郑保瑞监制，文念中造型但这些描述，也仅对港片影迷有效。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"说到底，港片在内地早已祛魅、也早已去势了。它的一小半精神还留在香港本王，更多的已随风而逝。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"从物料看，它更接近2018年的《无双》，走的是传统犯罪动作片的路线。影片拍黑客暗网，据说耗资2000万（港币）制作，我倒想看看，这个视觉化了的网络森林能搞出什么新意来吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 8","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-008.jpg","imageText":"《雷霆沙贺！众神之怒》\nHEESES RESTEA\n6.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月17日1第3个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：新线（华纳）","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房1-3亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点英雄可以沙雕，但电影能不那么沙雕吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"雷霆沙赞其实有机会弯道超车。它提出的问题是，如果超能力落在一个沙雕手里，会怎么样？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但影片给出了一个最没创意的回答：会闹出很多笑话。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"其实更可能的结果，是一场巨大的灾难。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此前有两部电影涉足这一禁区，一部是《超能失控》，另一部是2021年的《无辜者》一一恰好都不是超英电影。由此可见其玻璃天花板。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"至于这一部沙赞会不会有所突破？从预告片看，并无迹象。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"那也只好继续抱紧爆米花，乐呵乐呵得了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 9","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-009.jpg","imageText":"《荒原》\n3月3日与你作伴\n5.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月3日1首个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：麦特影业","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.0-7.0/票房300-800万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"看点荒漠版《地心引力》？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"可以对标的电影是阿索·卡隆的《地心弓力》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"两者都是大女主戏，都是失去男伴的情况下独自求生，虽然一个在大，一个在地，拍的却是相似的困境。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"如此倒到给这部《荒原》提出了极大的挑战。最困难之处还不在表演，而在导演的格和技法。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"卡隆最终把《地心引力》拍成了人之所以为人的证明，这是在强大的视听语言支撑下完成的。那么《荒原》又能做到几分？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 10","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-010.jpg","imageText":"《梅根》\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月17日1第3个周五","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：环球","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：票房1000-4000万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题√智能时代的亲子关系看点√ChatGPT会变成这么个恐怖玩意吗？","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这部由温子仁监制和编剧的惊悚片，来得及时。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"最近ChatGPT正火，虽然它还只是背靠大数据的语词游戏，但也难免让人担心，AI统治人类世界的畅想也许不远了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"其实，这部《梅根》在对技术的想象力上，已经过于落后。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"可它想探讨的问题，实际正在发生。片中那个叫“梅根”的恐怖AI娃娃。实际就是当代的手机、iPad。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"而当家长无力陪伴，把iPad扔给孩子的时候，实际“梅根”就已经坐在孩子身边了。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 11","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-011.jpg","imageText":"《龙与地下城：侠盗荣耀》\n龙与地不城\n侠盗荣耀\n月31日各显神通\n5.0\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月31日1第5个周末","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"出品方：派拉蒙","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分5.5-6.5/票房1-1.5亿","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"这是一部桌游IP改编电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"《龙与地下城》桌游诞生于1974年，也是桌上RPG游戏的开山鼻祖，对后世有深远影响，包括《魔兽世界》。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"此前华纳旗下的新线影业拍过三部曲，不太成功，这次转到派拉蒙手里，算是重启。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"对中国观众来说，没有这一层IP滤镜，本片就成了纯粹的奇幻大片，卖点是形态各异的圣物和人魔乱舞的奇观。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"据IMDB上描述，风格有点像《银河护卫》。考虑到导演是一对爱把喜剧元素加进各种类型的创作组合，大致可知其风格。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"可能惊喜 一1部Possible Surprise ?","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"","fontSize":18,"align":"center","bold":false,"italic":false,"alt":"3月院线：片不荒心慌！ · 配图 12","caption":"","width":100,"type":"image","src":"/uploads/archive/img-8978/fig-012.jpg","imageText":"《脐带》\n6.5\n期待值"},{"text":"上映日期：3月18日1第3个周五出品方：坏兔子（上海）影业","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"预计：豆瓣分6.5-7.5／票房100-300万","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"议题 故乡的失落看点阿尔兹海默症已经成了种种遗忘的喻体。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"又是一部关于阿尔兹海默症的电影。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"如果说《困在时间里的父亲》是以颅内VR方式，展现失忆者错乱的意识；《妈妈！》由温情滑可恐怖，给我们看的是失忆对于日常生活的破坏，进而引出遗忘历史的后患；那么《脐带》则把观众带回蒙古草原，去讲述故乡的失落和文化的消隐。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"很显然，阿尔兹海默症已经成了一种通用的愉体，在它不断变换的本体下，是不同创作者发出的相似声音：失忆是一件可怕的事。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"编辑/子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"排版/令令奇","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"preface":[{"text":"这是枪稿的新栏目：月度院线看片指南。此为第一期。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"很多号都在做，我们有几点不同：","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第一，片单不会长。能入选的电影，至少都有点看头；","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第二，分三类：①最为期待（当月重点影片）；②值得关注（有卖相，但需要观望）；③可能惊喜（偏小众趣味，但也有可能以小搏大）。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第三，每部影片除了基本信息，还会给出期待值、看点和涉及的社会议题（有则写明，无则空缺）。这也表明枪稿的态度，我们总是希望电影是观照现实的。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"第四，影片上映后，也可能与期待不符，但没关系，到时我们该夸夸，该骂骂。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"其实说到底，这个栏目最特别的地方，是出自枪稿。我们把哪些电影选进来，怎么排序，如何推介，就代表着枪稿的审美观。如果你觉得我们还算独特、靠谱，自然也就知道这个栏目的价值。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"3月份的片单，一共9部电影入选。片肯定是不荒，但看着有点心慌。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"一部被压了三年的现实题材，一部地震伤痕片，一部荒野求生，一部阿尔兹海默症，外加暗网、黄谣、AI杀人……眼看世界要毁，漫威DC那么多超级英雄，却只派来一个沙雕。","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"但我还是觉得这个片单不赖。并暗戳戳地开心，春节档终于终于过去了。【提醒：如果看不到片名，请关闭黑夜模式】","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"},{"text":"——枪稿主笔 子戈","fontSize":18,"align":"left","bold":false,"italic":false,"type":"paragraph"}],"prefaceOffset":2}